{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7dc157d77c893b6dd3b3348b9a04311eb1b1de5d44503b5ca4515ea2aeba71a7","ja":"とある日のお仕事終わり……","zh":"某天工作结束后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cef16d59cf5bf79f729ec0c24db5d705dae5cf6237c169204ae05b521125c5d1","ja":"撮影楽しかったネ♪　ワタシ、芸人さん達に\n負けないように、張り切りすぎちゃったヨ。","zh":"拍摄很开心♪我为了不输给搞笑艺人们，不知不觉太卖力了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e8a8276bce6cd113d34ea3dcb6340cba331466f392f1fce28fbeea260e207555","ja":"私も、精一杯頑張りました。放送が楽しみです。\nそれでは、帰る準備をしましょう。","zh":"我也已经竭尽全力了。好期待播出。\n那么，我们准备回去吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc2a4c6db273add60fe58cf3a4875f108ddfdfb7b846a49e5b59452372527bb8","ja":"あっ、もうこんな時間？\nお腹ペコペコだヨ～♪","zh":"啊，已经这么晚了？\n肚子饿得咕咕叫了哟～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"73d7e1d26ba968de1f94727beac7b19cbae09d19845fe112afa1903747800c93","ja":"それなら、今からみんなで、\n遅めのランチに行きませんか？","zh":"既然这样，现在要不要一起去吃个晚点的午餐？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"251da43e5a929dec77f98328aacb3d83de8aff2c16abe14f19f12d318ccd65b0","ja":"賛成だヨ～！　あ、それならワタシ、佐竹飯店に\n行きたいナ！　お腹いっぱいラーメンが食べたいヨ！","zh":"我赞成～！啊，这样的话，我想去佐竹饭店！好想吃一顿饱饱的拉面呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f85525ea1cfa97d088162e9f4f5b197ff5a5072a28911c319f8cfe127a6f29b8","ja":"そう言われたら、私も熱々の餃子が\n食べたくなってきました。……ごくり。","zh":"被你这么一说，我也开始想吃热腾腾的饺子了。……咽口水。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"dbd4f9c4b11329875f45a2df28e4741303f17fb762a8b6247944e7ca2d555125","ja":"わ、私も……小籠包が、食べたいな……。\nその、美奈子さんがよければ。ど、どうですか……？","zh":"我、我也……想吃小笼包……。\n那个，要是美奈子小姐愿意的话。你、你觉得怎么样……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"244a23ca03298db8a04406c039572f1d5010567f70c787fb4abdf22a4419a6d5","ja":"……美奈子さん？","zh":"……美奈子小姐？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5c5bdc5b6cce5a7c16bc1c2284b100f4aba559e06fa5790442bbec007e6492b3","ja":"あっ……う、うん！　もちろんうれしいよ。\nぜひ、食べに来て！","zh":"啊……嗯、嗯！当然开心呀。一定要来吃哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d9bfeea0bc02d5be0bdd3946f4bfc1db3fb38a8fe2f60e730e1929e8f7f4b8c5","ja":"あ、あの……な、なにか……\n気になること、あるんですか……？","zh":"啊，那个……有、有在意的事吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1928b538cfb41649530a33baac65b91b3b6791be9ec0532bd3de39c3b03cbe12","ja":"やっぱり……め、迷惑、だとか……。","zh":"果然还是……会、会给你添麻烦之类的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7b9a362a2ac4183029204f9474f298d3de564d78da81eccb91a3a9c1dd2c300a","ja":"そんなことないよ！　ただ……私もいつもみたいに、\nお料理を振る舞いたいって思うんだけど……。","zh":"没那回事！只是……我也想像平时一样，做饭给大家吃……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1807.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1e2dcbf881681e010f522eda9f09933ae9e2ad5f6a6ed9140f500a297fba6793","ja":"最近ね……お料理が……\nなんだか上手く、作れなくなっちゃって……。","zh":"最近啊……做饭……\n总觉得，变得不太会做了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
